  "description": "TreeWeaver thin consumer CLI as a .NET global tool. Install with `dotnet tool install -g TreeWeaver.Cli`, then run `treeweaver search/ask/ingest/document/...` against any TreeWeaver HTTP API. Talks to the server over HTTP via the typed TreeWeaver.Client — no engine, no local OpenSearch. Configure the endpoint + key once with `treeweaver config use`.",
